rW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"bSJczuohHVko33UT82hnfA","review_id":"jFzUftIx6urRkymhTDeIlQ","date":"2015-04-24T20:07:54","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9482945203781128,"text_excerpt":"Yummy! I finally made it over here for lunch today. There are already a bunch of pizza options in this area, but Blaze has a different concept on theirs. I'd say it's like the Chipotle of the pizza world. They serve fast and fresh quality pizzas where you can customize your order to exactly how you want it. We came in at noon with the rest of the lunch crowd. The line was long and backed up to the door. It moved fairly quickly though. I chose the build your own pizza instead of one of their signature pizzas. It's pretty cool. For $7.95 you get an 11\" pizza and can load it up with as many toppings as you desire. First, you choose your crust - regular or gluten free (gluten free costs extra..."},{"business_id":"bSJczuohHVko33UT82hnfA","review_id":"joCnyXwIO4sGQVWh10tXrg","date":"2016-07-14T20:25:51","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9439452290534973,"text_excerpt":"Easily and without a doubt my favorite food is pizza. Bury me with it. New Orleans is trying to get up in the pizza game and it's about time; we are way behind. Yes we have Pizza D and yes there's Mid City Pizza, Slice and let's not forget Theo's. However where each of those places excel in ingredients and tastiness, it's hard to find an excellent pie that is relative in price to the cost of what it takes to make each one. Blaze has that component down packed and for that, they're getting my #1 best pizza spot in Nola...for now. You can get a nice sized pie for under $10 with however many toppings you want in any combination. It's like the Subway of pizza but I dare not put Blaze's qualit..."},{"business_id":"bSJczuohHVko33UT82hnfA","review_id":"hhY2A-c8n-SHcBFvaIVXSw","date":"2017-02-15T19:39:36","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9412563443183899,"text_excerpt":"Love this place. Incredibly fast. Very good pizza. And the price is affordable($7.95 for unlimited toppings) If you've never been here before, it's an assembly line pizza place (imagine subway or chipotle, but for pizza). The staff is always very friendly and willing to put any special spin you want on your pizza. Great for lunch or dinner. The venue is quite spacious and can accommodate large groups easily"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"bSJczuohHVko33UT82hnfA","photo_id":"d6ggzgIADAACW8PJyo_pSg","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/d6ggzgIADAACW8PJyo_pSg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8665252327919006},{"business_id":"bSJczuohHVko33UT82hnfA","photo_id":"tUCURuuqzMyJT7LaGFeKBw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/tUCURuuqzMyJT7LaGFeKBw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8449563980102539},{"business_id":"bSJczuohHVko33UT82hnfA","photo_id":"eWu9Ggjl0cRzHO3aaANQAQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/eWu9Ggjl0cRzHO3aaANQAQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8447532653808594},{"business_id":"bSJczuohHVko33UT82hnfA","photo_id":"OQr1vbJET4Rf_Q-um_F6KA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/OQr1vbJET4Rf_Q-um_F6KA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8408359289169312},{"business_id":"bSJczuohHVko33UT82hnfA","p